<worksheet>
  <title>Homework 03</title>

 <objectives>
    <introduction>
        <p>
            The purpose of the homework is to:
        </p>
    </introduction>
   <ul>
        <li>
            <p>
             Practice applying the concepts and techniques discussed this week
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <p>
             Reveal gaps in your understanding so you know what to study
            </p>
        </li>

        <li>
            <p>
                Enable a productive re-read of the textbook chapter/engagement with
                other course resources.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <conclusion>
        <p>
          The homework is both a valuable learning opportunity and a gauge of how
          well you're doing. Did you solve all the problems by yourself with no help? Incredible!
          If that didn't happen, that's OK: we're not expected to get everything right the first time.
          What you need to do is look carefully at what you needed help with, and then make a study plan,
          which will likely include solving more problems, to fill in the gaps in your understanding.
        </p>
    </conclusion>
  </objectives>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      <alert>Instructions:</alert> Complete all the exercises below and submit your work by the due date.
